claim.claim-text:
a combustor section arranged between a compressor section and a turbine section;
a fan section having an array of twenty-six or fewer fan blades, wherein the fan section has a fan pressure ratio of less than 1.55;
a geared architecture coupling the fan section to the turbine section or the compressor section; and
an airfoil as claimed in any preceding claim.

